# ValaryArena

Wiki: `AGENTS.md`. JAR proprio, package `com.valaryrpg.arena`. Non è un modulo Core.

- Testi/permessi/suoni/delay/coord/cap/nomi mob → YAML. Java orchestra. Brand solo in `lang/messages.yml`.
- Helper: `Tasks`, `MessageService`, `SoundService`, `ConsoleCommands`, `StorageManager`.
- Async: copy/delete mondo, SQL kill/milestone, chunk spawn. Sync: load/unload, TP, Mythic.
- Max 4 per boss/dungeon, tetto `config.yml` `instances.max-loaded` (16). Coda RAM. Niente `PlayerMoveEvent`.
- Arena: clone `source-spawner`. Dungeon: posizioni `wave` + piano `waves:`, glow ultimo minion, leash, `intro`/`outro`, spawn-safe stanza 1, holo spawn-forward poi follow-door. Clear = ondate/pack esausti + 0 living UUID.
- Scoreboard TAB (softdepend): `scoreboard.arena` e `scoreboard.dungeon`, `enabled: false` per spegnerle. PAPI `%valary_*%`. `config.yml` `blocked-commands`. Niente bossbar.
- Kill/milestone **per player**. Cap `max-bosses` → stop + TP.
- Mai `compileOnly` sul Core: kit/eco = `[console]` in YAML.
- Commit come **Nyxon-com**, mai Haze/Cursor Agent. Non compilare se non chiesto.
